      "sourceHash": "57686bd65b9c04159ea609fc2a1afaed39569ed25ba62c6d1a45300583b6c925",
      "contextFingerprint": "c89e8be62037b3f236e4d58228d36dcb2fb6b61444cf9c7f9e36bb4d82458c0a",
      "sourceText": "1. **return 时不要加 std::move**：让编译器自动优化（RVO/NRVO）。\n2. **赋值给已有对象时用 `std::move(source)`**：用 `target = std::move(source)` 避免拷贝。\n3. **move 后不要再用源对象**（除非重新赋值或重置）。\n4. **移动构造函数必须标记 `noexcept`**：否则 STL 容器在扩容时不会调用它。\n5. **`std::move` 不移动任何东西**：它只是类型转换，把左值变成右值引用。真正的移动发生在移动构造函数或移动赋值运算符中。",
      "translatedText": "1. **Do not add std::move on return**: let the compiler optimize automatically (RVO/NRVO)\\.\n2. **Use when assigning to an existing object `std::move(source)`**: use `target = std::move(source)` to avoid copying\\.\n3. **Do not use the source object again after move**(unless reassigned or reset)\\.\n4. **Move constructors must be marked `noexcept`**: otherwise STL containers will not call it during reallocation\\.\n5. **`std::move` does not move anything**: it is just a type cast that turns an lvalue into an rvalue reference\\. The actual move happens in the move constructor or move assignment operator\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
